                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I'm playing games in alphabetical order and you can watch my review here: https://youtu.be/HSliwJYBPog\n\nPrefer to read?\nThis is an ultra-basic block placing game where you choose from 3 shapes to place on the board. You can't rotate them and they aren't affected by gravity. Form a line to remove it from the board, and then continue until you lose. There's no end, no high score list, and despite what the store description claims, there's no storyline.\nYou can find plenty of free apps that do exactly this, and more.",
